{"id":"n73674-1-9","stage":3,"title":"일시 · 时日","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73674-1-9-1","ko":"나중에 기회가 되면 저도 꼭 불러 주세요.","zh":"以后有机会的话，也请一定要叫上我。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나중에","meaning":"之后","explanation":"나중：之后；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"나중","audio":"/audio/b8922cba892bea4a603a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62275","senseId":"2","lemma":"나중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나중에","audio":"/audio/a12252500035668f76c9.mp3"}},{"text":"기회가","meaning":"机会，机遇，时机","explanation":"기회：机会，机遇，时机；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"기회","audio":"/audio/1815f64fee30a098d49f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73494","senseId":"1","lemma":"기회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기회가","audio":"/audio/5a2cf36540e9e0d75d4b.mp3"}},{"text":"되면","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되면","audio":"/audio/dee0b5432173736e9b50.mp3"}},{"text":"저도","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저도","audio":"/audio/2e274ebad4675928ad87.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}},{"text":"불러","meaning":"请，叫","explanation":"부르다：请，叫；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"9","lemma"